            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 1:12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no amiyo win or k'awaco riwin ni, “Makada nende Rwoth Were mewin otieko miyo win lowo me bed'iye, jolweny mewin je joripo ŋado gi gilweny kadho konyo wade mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka mon mewin, nyithindho, kodi ogwaŋe mewin, paka aŋeyo nike withoth g'ogwaŋe, ama jowodoŋ i tindin m'atieko miyo win; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tundo kama Rwoth otiek miyo wade mewin kaywomirok paka win, to jo bende jomako lowo ma Rwoth Were miyo jo kalo Yordan, kenyo kisi dhano nyalo gik i lim pere m'atieko miyo win.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiyo Yosuwa bende or i hongo no k'awaco ni, Waŋin otieko neno kisi gima Rwoth Were mewin otieko timo ri kerin ario me, ameno bende Rwoth latimo ri kerin je ma wicegin ŋado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikir'ilwor jo, kole Rwoth Were mewin, lalwenyo riwin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa ŋiyo Kanan gi Pisiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
